<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY MOL ISSUE PRICE SET $16.25-SOURCE.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY MOL ISSUE PRICE SET $16.25-SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The subscription price in the next phase of Hungarian oil company MOL Rt was set at $16.25 or 2,970 forints a share, a source close to the deal told Reuters.</p>
<p>Additional details were not immediately available but Hungary's privatisation agency APV Rt said earlier it would place 12.5 percent, leaving a 2.5 percent over-allotment option, with institutional investors.</p>
<p>It also said it would offer a one percent stake publicly to domestic investors, with an additional three percent stake in reserves to meet higher demand.</p>
<p>-- Emese Bartha, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
